{"repo": {"description": {"en-US": "Apps by Sovereign Edge Inc. for GrapheneOS and Pixel. Pocket Agent, a private on-device Claude agent; Pocket Pantry, a pantry, grocery cart and Claude recipes app; Pocket Concierge, an offline HTML itinerary viewer with Claude; and Pocket Coach, an open-source strength training app with spreadsheet plan import."}, "timestamp": 1792624139000}, "packages": {"com.sovereignedge.pocketcoach": {"metadata": {"added": 1792193697000, "categories": ["Sports & Health"], "issueTracker": "https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-coach/issues", "lastUpdated": 1792201712000, "license": "Apache-2.0", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/frenchtoastbig7-ux/pocket-coach", "authorName": "Sovereign Edge Inc.", "name": {"en-US": "Pocket Coach"}, "summary": {"en-US": "Strength training programs, set logging, 1RM tracking and spreadsheet plan import"}, "description": {"en-US": "Pocket Coach is an open-source strength and conditioning app in the spirit of TrainHeroic: a coach writes a program, the athlete follows it day by day, logs every set and watches their numbers move.\n\n* Today: a week strip with the session your program puts on each day, one tap from starting\n* Programs: weeks x days of sessions made of blocks (supersets) with per-set prescriptions as % of 1RM, RPE or a fixed load\n* Workout logging with targets already turned into kilos or pounds, a rest timer and automatic estimated one-rep maxes\n* Library of about 90 exercises plus your own, each with a 1RM, an e1RM chart and full history\n* Progress: totals, a 12-week volume chart, records and history\n* Import a training plan from a CSV or Excel spreadsheet, or a Pocket Coach program file; export programs to share with athletes\n\nEverything stays on the phone: no account, no server, no analytics, and the app has no network permission."}, "preferredSigner": "b3527f4e3fb3aebcc861ffc8b8ea2b4eb461c48d2ce631972eed564fc37e3446"}, "versions": {"e99832cf34af83c229b4464d17d0b90f2614b1dad4c010d2d0